From: Sungsu Ahn <sungsu_ahn@korea.ac.kr>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 02:58:13 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 49/51] Lookup log2 histogram per timed GetAnchor (read/write),
 GetObjectLookupHist API (build 79)

coh::TimedAnchor adds the index-lookup cycles of each call to a per-thread log2
histogram (bins in TSC cycles: bin 0 = 0, bin i = [2^(i-1), 2^i), last open);
read side at the object ReadStart / KV Get sites, write side at the object
WriteStart / KV Put sites. Only already-timed (sampled) sections record.
New API rackobj::GetObjectLookupHist(ObjectLookupHist*) exports counts, sums
and bin lower edges in ns (TSC rate); existing structs and counters unchanged.
object-test checks the histogram in the uncontended section-check case
(read samples == check_sampled, totals match read_lookup_ns_sampled).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
